<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-10-14T06:20:04.354Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 06:20:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Houthis have intensified attacks on Saudi targets, striking the Saudi Aramco headquarters and a Saudi airport, causing casualties and prompting missile interceptions over Riyadh and other Saudi sites. Saudi coalition forces responded with airstrikes on oil facilities west of Sanaa and Houthi positions, while the United Nations warned that Yemen has slipped back into full-scale war. Cholera cases have surged in Yemen as the conflict worsens, according to the WHO. The conflict produced 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/11/world/middleeast/saudi-arabia-options-houthis.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168559&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxOdlBJb0pFZTlFdzNJQ2w4aFRSU1pQRkxJbmdyTWRCZWdDczVLdTk1cVNCZE10MXpNbjVSYWdYODNkbEwwS19MaERrSTNxZFRFZ2RVU2FWTlktOVN1NWN5VTBuTDF6M3B1dS1OX3dxMEFTUGxua056TE9ESmZrLTlLR1hlcDF1LWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxNSjJFa2JRQjRkY3pPMHE2cHRDYm5CVG1WelNfbW1fdEdta0Vvc1NLejloSHRHSjNVZ2dnNHFYZlM5cHRkQUNBd2xKMXAzUURGcHRRWWRQQVdTclVES3BQZ0ZOUUhUQ3g4c0ktYk5JaDRINGRPV2lmSXFGU3lCcGFGR2lrcjNDS1dheHFZam1Yc0JuaEtaQ0Z4SmVUMkM4NXlFUTM4Z1BTTDMxSzg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxQR002VVo0b3ZvU0RXV3V5TWdvX0Jmc1NiQjBDNjljbTVWbFZnQ1hIUm5WTUNHZFZSNlV4WWoxZVBDNFhwZUEzZF9kVUlla0dZOWstVWZQQnA1TGpqeXI4Y05KbkpOay00U3NLYkZxZ1BHQWQ4ay14eEk3bHlfSzBMVzlrd2tuQ1hyaHoteGZSZ0pyYjdvYjB1QlEtOTR1YVNZZnZTRw?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/crx2d60y1py3o?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&l